# The image builds office-cli from the workspace and copies data/, so the build
# context is only what that needs. Everything else stays out, so a local
# `fly deploy` uploads the same few dozen MB as a clean clone, whatever build
# output, app builds or caches the checkout has accumulated.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!apps/cli/
!apps/office-web/
# A workspace member, so Cargo needs its manifest and sources to load the workspace.
!apps/mobile-ffi/
!data/

# Build output and caches anywhere inside what is kept.
**/target
**/build
**/node_modules
**/.gradle
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*~
